## Next useful work

Do not spend another native run merely to rediscover exit 47. First inspect
the existing coordinator's fixed rejection-code handling and reproduce its
source/path/resource preconditions locally with generated fixtures. Preserve
raw-text restrictions and all security gates. If finer native evidence is
still needed, transport only an allowlisted coordinator rejection code, with
synthetic coverage, before seeking separate approval for any new attempt.
The current approval is consumed. Internal root cause and fix remain unproven.

Real-input host admission and verified 4B CPU import still precede Gate 6
GPU smoke/save/resume/SFT. Gates 7 evaluation and 8 serving remain later.
